{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Stronger than you","artist":"Steven Universe","date":"2026-07-14","sourceId":"YzJm-mk52WM:001","sourceHash":"6a30fb3422f2e9c87f1cf209a25e5603da3dc1413b708e04f0b447100ec98a96","duration":206.3,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":14.57,"end":15.67,"text":"This is Garnet","translation":"이쪽은 가넷","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":15.67,"end":16.47,"text":"Back together","translation":"다시 하나가 됐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":16.47,"end":18.31,"text":"And I'm never going down","translation":"너 같은 것의 손에","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":18.31,"end":19.97,"text":"at the hands of the likes of you","translation":"절대 쓰러지지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":19.97,"end":21.35,"text":"Because I'm so much better","translation":"내가 훨씬 더 나으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":21.35,"end":24.15,"text":"And every part of me is saying \"go get her\"","translation":"내 모든 부분이 가서 해치우라 외치니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":24.65,"end":26.67,"text":"The two of us ain't gonna follow your rules","translation":"우리 둘은 네 규칙 따위 따르지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":26.67,"end":29.21,"text":"Come at me without any of your fancy tools","translation":"그 화려한 도구 없이 내게 덤벼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":29.21,"end":31.51,"text":"Let's go, just me and you","translation":"해 보자 너와 나 둘이서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":31.77,"end":33.41,"text":"Let's go, just one on two","translation":"해 보자 둘을 상대로 혼자서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":33.41,"end":35.63,"text":"Go ahead and try and hit me if you're able","translation":"할 수 있다면 날 때려 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":35.63,"end":38.33,"text":"Can't you see that my relationship is stable?","translation":"우리 관계가 단단한 게 안 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":38.33,"end":40.61,"text":"I can see you hate the way we intermingle","translation":"우리가 섞이는 모습이 네겐 싫겠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":40.61,"end":43.01,"text":"But I think you're just mad 'cause you're single","translation":"하지만 넌 혼자라 화난 것뿐인 것 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":43.01,"end":45.3,"text":"And you're not gonna stop what we made together","translation":"우리가 함께 만든 걸 넌 막지 못해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":45.3,"end":47.38,"text":"We are gonna stay like this forever","translation":"우린 영원히 이 모습으로 남을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":47.38,"end":50.02,"text":"If you break us apart we'll just come back newer","translation":"우릴 갈라놓아도 새 모습으로 돌아와","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":50.02,"end":52.74,"text":"And we'll always be twice the gem that you are","translation":"그리고 언제나 너보다 두 배 빛나는 보석일 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":52.74,"end":54.02,"text":"I am made o-o-o-o-of","translation":"나는 이루어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":54.02,"end":56.32,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":56.32,"end":57.38,"text":"O-o-o-o-of","translation":"이루어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":57.38,"end":58.5,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":64.72,"end":66.66,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":66.66,"end":69.4,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":76.54,"end":77.08,"text":"Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm","translation":"음음음음음","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":80.0,"end":82.58,"text":"Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm","translation":"음음음음음","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":86.24,"end":87.94,"text":"This is who we are","translation":"이게 바로 우리야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":94.66,"end":97.04,"text":"This is who I am","translation":"이게 바로 나야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":97.3,"end":99.48,"text":"And if you think you can stop me","translation":"네가 날 막을 수 있다고 생각한다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":99.48,"end":101.84,"text":"Then you need to think again","translation":"다시 생각해야 할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":102.24,"end":104.2,"text":"'Cause I am a feeling","translation":"나는 하나의 감정이니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":104.48,"end":106.74,"text":"And I will never end","translation":"나는 절대 끝나지 않으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":106.74,"end":109.03,"text":"And I won't let you hurt my planet","translation":"내 행성을 네가 해치게 두지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":109.03,"end":111.69,"text":"And I won't let you hurt my friends","translation":"내 친구들을 네가 해치게 두지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":111.85,"end":114.31,"text":"Go ahead and try and hit me if you're able!","translation":"할 수 있다면 날 때려 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":114.31,"end":116.77,"text":"Can't you see that my relationship is stable?","translation":"우리 관계가 단단한 게 안 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":116.77,"end":119.19,"text":"I know you think I'm not something you're afraid of","translation":"넌 내가 두려워할 존재가 아니라고 생각하지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":119.19,"end":121.49,"text":"'Cause you think that you've seen what I'm made of","translation":"내가 무엇으로 이루어졌는지 봤다고 여기니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":121.49,"end":123.89,"text":"Well, I am even more than the two of them!","translation":"하지만 나는 그 둘을 합친 것보다 더 커","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":124.22,"end":126.02,"text":"Everything they care about is what I am!","translation":"그들이 아끼는 모든 것이 바로 나야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":126.02,"end":128.7,"text":"I am their fury, I am their patience","translation":"나는 그들의 분노 나는 그들의 인내","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":128.7,"end":130.56,"text":"I am a conversation!","translation":"나는 둘의 대화야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":130.76,"end":132.42,"text":"I am made o-o-o-o-of","translation":"나는 이루어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":132.42,"end":138.88,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":138.88,"end":139.74,"text":"O-o-o-o-of","translation":"이루어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":139.74,"end":141.78,"text":"And it's stronger than you","translation":"그리고 그 사랑은 너보다 강해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":141.78,"end":142.74,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":